# Implementation notes: design docs, task plans and anything else written
# while building a feature. These are internal working notes, and this
# repository is public — the published documentation is README.md, and the
# npm package ships only what `files` in package.json lists (dist/ and
# babel-plugin.js), so nothing here ever reached the package anyway.
#
# To publish something from here deliberately, either add it with
# `git add -f <path>` or un-ignore its folder with a `!docs/<name>/` line
# below this one.
docs/

# Internal architecture reference kept for whoever picks the work up.
# README.md is the documentation this project publishes.
context.md
